{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch79UG8MfUJiJGCdtbWvx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I left out the line saying every other publisher pays at least $12,000. Your facts don't support it: you have one $12,500 fee, and your agent's range starts at $11,000. If the editor knows other illustrators getting less, that one line could make the rest of your case look weaker. The facts you do have make a strong case, and asking for $11,500 while pointing to $12,500 elsewhere makes your request look reasonable.\n\nFill in the bracketed parts before sending. If you'd rather not mention your agent, you could change that part to \"the standard range I'm seeing.\"\n\n<final_document>\nSubject: Fee for [Book Title]\n\nHi [Editor's name],\n\nThank you for offering me [Book Title]. I'm excited about it and would love to take it on.\n\nBefore I say yes, I'd like to talk about the fee. I've been at $9,000 per book since our first project four years ago. Six books later, two of our titles have each sold more than 20,000 copies, and [Title] was chosen for the [State] reading list. I'm proud of what we've built together.\n\nEach book is about four months of full-time work for me. Last year another publisher paid me $12,500 for a book of the same length. My agent tells me $11,000 to $13,000 is the standard range for an illustrator with my record.\n\nWith that in mind, I'm asking for $11,500 for this book. That's at the lower end of the range and below my most recent fee elsewhere, because working with your team matters to me and I'd like to keep doing it.\n\nCould we talk this week? I'm happy to jump on a call if that's easier.\n\nBest,\n[Your name]\n</final_document>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5370,"cache_read_input_tokens":3853,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":537